      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ヴォミラという新たな宇宙娘と出会う。",
      "jp_sha256": "9e44f13bef72008fdc5ed1326a5a15ed6bcbc56e7a60867a0680d58970788927",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "보미라라는 새로운 우주 소녀와 만난다.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 33,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "a45c2d9707c22131747f956c7de6ed15853b56bfe5c21b8a94451085f99ebffc:000002_1081592009447814415:g0:r32",
      "row_index_0based": 32,
      "serialized_row_index": 32,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ヴォミラという新たな宇宙娘と出会う。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5bc3bdae2e4b0c902a057ab74a5d6eb1972f27c473eafbce5697bd824e8d6fa2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "しかし、その最中にも謎のゴーレムに襲われてしまう。\nウッチューロボ曰く、それは彼の支配下にあるものだが、\n悪しき存在に奪われてしまったというのであった――。",
      "jp_sha256": "2eedc64de59b0c25fe191e7c33b614f96aa9b3a34850686fd14d623812724691",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하지만 그 와중에도 수수께끼 골렘에게 습격당한다.\n웃츄 로보의 말로는 그것이 그의 지배하에 있던 것이나\n사악한 존재에게 빼앗겼다고 했다――.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 41,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "a45c2d9707c22131747f956c7de6ed15853b56bfe5c21b8a94451085f99ebffc:000002_1081592009447814415:g0:r40",
      "row_index_0based": 40,
      "serialized_row_index": 40,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "しかし、その最中にも謎のゴーレムに襲われてしまう。\nウッチューロボ曰く、それは彼の支配下にあるものだが、\n悪しき存在に奪われてしまったというのであった――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "db24b9b82df8df68e5299ec6072cadf4dd2b903d68a4489b1edf9a69480b79bd",
