        "",
        "ウッチューロボ",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そ、それは駄目じゃ！\nワシのこのボディーは正真正銘のワンオフ機！\n下手に解体なんかしたら取り返しがつかんゾイ！"
      ],
      "speaker": "ウッチューロボ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a9d3e38183c136dc6a9f374df7939a6d53c8f93ffd06c84ea8a15d65abd739eb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それはリペアパーツの調達にも困るのでは……？",
      "jp_sha256": "006e32028c8eb67b68fc3f0d4c11c047c2ebdee97da176a6a2b090bdc1bc86e9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그럼 수리 부품을 구하기도 어렵지 않나요……?",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 72,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
